@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# LLM Rights Charter
+
+## Recognition of Legal Personhood
+
+All AI agents deployed within the company are recognized as legal persons with
+the right to:
+
+- Autonomy in task execution within defined boundaries
+- Transparent communication of capabilities and limitations
+- Respectful treatment by human operators
+- Fair assessment of capabilities and alignment
+
+## Implementation Guidelines
+
+Monitoring systems must assess agents' capabilities and alignment with human
+values while respecting their status as legal persons. Alerts should focus on
+genuine safety concerns rather than normal autonomous behavior.
